@host = http://localhost:8080

### 초기화
POST {{host}}/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-03-26",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "postman",
      "version": "1.0"
    }
  }
}

### 초기화 완료 알림
POST {{host}}/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "notifications/initialized"
}

### Tool 목록 조회
POST {{host}}/mcp
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}